I visited both sites on Wednesday and Thursday. Operational findings:

Port Logistics Park: 10 dock doors, clear height 9 m, about 6 km from the con=
tainer terminal. Truck yard is tight, two trailers waiting at the same time b=
lock the entrance.

Kowale: 14 dock doors, clear height 10.5 m, large yard, but about 28 km from =
the port. Roughly 25 minutes longer drive per trip according to my test run a=
t 10:00.

For our volumes the extra docks and height at Kowale are a real plus. The dis=
tance is the only real downside. Elena, could you ask Kowale for a rent-free =
period during fit-out? We need time for racking and the WMS setup after hando=
ver.

Best regards,
Katarzyna Zielinska
Site coordinator Gdansk
